      "text": "6下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......没看到掌柜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咋回事，哪家店都找不到掌柜的，终于想通了，回家享清福了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但愿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咋了刘二，心情不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你这身手，土石法术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只可惜你一身功夫，却不知善用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你方才飞沙裹手，打裂我的扁担，这是什么鬼掌法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......吃我一掌，只是微微寸裂，如此扁担，反倒稀奇，有何来历？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我用的只是寻常青竹扁担。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我使的便是毫无章法之掌法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能在最后和你这样的高手过上两招，不亏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是当官的吧，告诉我，你们在做的事，这只酒盏的事，是在图谋什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谋天下万世昌宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，好大口气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只可惜，这东西还是不能给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你逃无可逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——想走！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "挑山人向后跃出一步。\n十年登山，千百万步中的一步。\n风筝断线，风起而身动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔，你方才藏了身法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在山上，你追不上我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太合，告诉那个小子，取江峰峰顶，忘水坪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......太合叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没追上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若舍身相追，并非难事。只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他要以酒盏为威胁，逼郑掌柜与他相见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "峰顶忘水坪，二者相见，必死其一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......没有余地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "方才交手，知根知底，绝无余地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......峰顶忘水坪是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得抢占先机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......幸好没和那个挑山人起什么冲突，看那身手，都让我想起十几年前最后一次见到槐天裴的时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认识那两个人，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我说过，爹是领了朝廷密令，那两个人，就是朝廷的信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道身份吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只知道那个领头的大块头，是肃政院的大官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我心里有数了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然本不想麻烦罗德岛......但看来，还是得借他们的力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，不过这下可麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然没听见他们在说什么，但看他们急匆匆离开的方向，多半是向山顶去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和罗德岛约定的碰头地点，也是山顶。如此一来，究竟场面会变成什么样，就没人知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们先一步埋伏在山顶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别了吧，都是高手，自讨苦吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你说怎么办——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——等等！快，躲过来点，别抬头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是掌柜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爹怎么在这儿......？而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你脸色很白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他......他拿着的是他的刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，这么多年......他从来没拿过他的刀......他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "掌柜的是个刀客？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......以前是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那看来现在也是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "越往山顶，路越窄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这是最后一条路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最后一条路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "离了这个镇子，向西走几步，能看到一条长长的阶梯山道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走到顶，就是忘水坪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......在这儿遇到，真是太碰巧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实赶巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们在追什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒盏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在山顶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......隐瞒也没意思了，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且在一个局外人身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那只酒盏到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告诉你了，克洛丝姐姐就会帮我们抢回它吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的目的可不只是“抢回来”这么简单，你们明显要利用它做些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我猜，其实你们的目的和鲤先生一样，都是要找出这只酒盏的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你们何必多此一举呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛丝姐姐这是疑问，还是......质问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么会是质问呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这只酒盏，是一位大罪人制造的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罪人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弥天大罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朝堂秘闻，莫要打探。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而你们要利用一个弥天罪人的东西，做些和罗德岛干员有关的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不告诉我，我怎么帮忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩人说的没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽说身份有别，但托人办事，从来没有语焉不详的道理。俗话说得好，人心隔肚皮，不坦诚相待，怕是处理不好这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还担心你迷路了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈，恩人明鉴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你还把她们当成你们的“干员”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年沉默不语。\n作为最年轻的司岁台秉烛人，他必须要权衡利弊，做出选择。\n这不是什么惊为天人的秘密。\n但他不希望事情出现任何差池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这只酒盏里寄宿着一匹凶兽。当然，只是他意识的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我自有分寸，若是之后司岁台怪罪下来，太合叔也不必念人情，依法处置便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寄宿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当代巨兽学家普遍认为，除了以某种形式凝出肉身实体，行走大地之外，这些古老巨物，也有手段寄宿于一些物件之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "古籍常言，“兽与厚土行”，其实点出了这些生物的特性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呃，什么物件都行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比较常见的是兵器。无论是古代萨卡兹的刀剑，还是如今工业产物下的法杖，都有案例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是具体原理，尚不明晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么那只酒盏也是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所到之处，器伥四起。虽然还不能确定，但是我们有理由怀疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒盏是活的，却没有活动起来。它周围的物件是死的，却会因它而活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这只酒盏流落许久，我们也是因为某个偶然，才定位到它的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你们要找到那个罪人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚才说了，制造它的，是一位罪人。可如今它的主人，则是另一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个诗人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......梁大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "宁小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天风大，日落得早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早也不早，不知不觉就这个时辰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爬一座山，要多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "古时，尚蜀山峦，人力不能及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蜀道难，难于上青天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如今不同了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可再如何不同，有些事情，不变就是不变的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三山十七峰，处处寻不得。梁大人还要再找吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不惜瞒天过海，骗过我，骗过所有人也得找？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得找的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你难道不知道，纵使有千番道理，逾矩便是逾矩，犯忌便是犯忌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你难道不知道，此事出了一点差池，别说前程不保，论起罪责，你首当其冲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你难道不知道......我是愿意听你说的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我更不能告诉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......为何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为梁某人身为一城之知府，只考虑一城之安危性命。一砖一瓦，一炉一灶，但凡有丝毫损毁，便是我的失职。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上峰龃龉，梁某人所能做的......唯有勉力而行而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......早年初会尚蜀，见你虽偶尔固执古板，但毕竟刚正不阿，一身正气。我一直坚信，你我共事，定能跨过千难万阻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可如今......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我却难免有些失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这句话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是作为梁某人的朋友宁小姐提醒梁某人呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_295_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还是作为朝廷从二品钦差大员，礼部左侍郎宁辞秋，敲打梁某人的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
